[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13937.75, "timestamp": "03:52:17", "text": "我而言，我正在努力挽回我糟糕的人生，因為我太自私了，我太蠢了，我犧牲了自己的一切，我的事業，所有的一切，都投入到那些毫無意義的事情中。直播也是如此，我真希望我沒有把那麼多時間花在直播和比賽上。  我說的沒錯，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13938.55, "timestamp": "03:52:18", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "its oka nervousness gets us yapping even more"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13952.331, "timestamp": "03:52:32", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "good stuff"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13959.51, "timestamp": "03:52:39", "text": "當我看到周圍的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13963.429, "timestamp": "03:52:43", "text": "人都專注於他們的現實生活"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13970.87, "timestamp": "03:52:50", "text": "，呃，所有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13975.75, "timestamp": "03:52:55", "text": "那些學業上的事情，我以前完全不關注這些，我一直活在自己的世界裡，對吧？現在我正在吸取教訓，對吧？我們都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13977.59, "timestamp": "03:52:57", "text": "人，我們會從錯誤中學習，是的，我們會努力適應，我們會努力設定一個合適的目標並朝著它努力，對吧？"}]